<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Giidings &amp; Lewis cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Giidings &amp; Lewis cut.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Goldman Sachs downgraded Giddings &amp; Lewis Inc to market perform from market outperform.</p>
<p>-- Giddings &amp; Lewis gained 5/64 to 20-13/16.</p>
<p>-- On Thursday, Gidding &amp; Lewis agreed to be acquired by Thyssen AG.</p>
</text>
